OL,3,GNEWSAWW2 explosives found on coastal
OL,4,Afootpath
OL,5,
OL,6,FDangerous World War Two explosives were
OL,7,Funcovered by a walker along a coastal
OL,8,Ffootpath on the Isle of Man.
OL,10,FAn area around Spanish Head had to be
OL,11,Fclosed off after the "munitions" were
OL,12,Ffound on the Raad ny Foillan coastal
OL,13,Fpath on Wednesday, the islands
OL,14,Fcoastguard said.
OL,16,FPaths between The Sound Cafe and The
OL,17,FChasms were later reopened on Thursday
OL,18,Fafter the explosives were made safe by
OL,19,Fa team from the Army.
OL,21,FThe area sits close to a former wartime
OL,22,Fradar station.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
